<!-- HOW VNG OPERATES -->
<section class="cx-problem cx-section" id="how-we-operate">
  <div class="cx-container">
    <div class="r">
      <div class="cx-eyebrow">How VNG Operates</div>
      <h2 class="cx-h2">Six principles we hold ourselves<br>to on every project.</h2>
      <p class="cx-sub" style="max-width:580px">These are not marketing statements. They are the operational standards our team is built around and what every client can expect from the first site visit to final handoff.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cx-not-list stagger">
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <h3>Experienced operators on site from day one.</h3>
        <p>VNG puts seasoned project operators on site from the start. People who know the job, know the trades, and can solve problems without escalating everything up a chain of command. Your project gets real attention from people who treat your deadline as their own.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <h3>Scalable crew when timelines demand it.</h3>
        <p>VNG has the team depth to mobilize additional crews mid-project when the schedule requires it. Weekend pushes, extended hours, resequenced work. We do not accept the slip. We find a way to recover it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <h3>Itemized quotes with no hidden costs.</h3>
        <p>VNG quotes are fully itemized. Exclusions are listed explicitly. Conditions that could affect scope are flagged upfront. You know exactly what you are paying for before we start, and that number does not change without your approval.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <h3>Specialists in commercial interiors.</h3>
        <p>We focus exclusively on commercial interior execution: tenant improvements, fit-outs, medical renovations, restaurant builds. That specialization means we know the sector-specific requirements, the common failure points, and how to navigate them cleanly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <h3>We call you before things become problems.</h3>
        <p>VNG identifies risks in advance, including permit delays, long-lead items, and spatial conflicts between trades, then re-sequences work before your timeline takes a hit. You get a call with a solution, not a call with a surprise.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <h3>The work we quote is work we do.</h3>
        <p>Our core trades, framing, drywall, demolition, finishing, are in-house. That means direct accountability and consistent quality from the same crew that agreed to your scope. No communication gaps. No handoff loss.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

